    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR centralizes default path resolution logic for the `udb` Ruby gem so schema/data paths work correctly both in-repo and when the gem is installed standalone, avoiding the previous incorrect default in `yaml_resolver.rb`.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Introduces `lib/udb/paths.rb` as the shared source of truth for `Udb.repo_root`, `Udb.gem_path`, and `Udb.default_*_path` helpers.\n- Updates `yaml_resolver.rb` to default `schemas_path` via `Udb.default_schemas_path` (instead of a repo-relative `__dir__` heuristic).\n- Bumps gem version from `0.1.2` to `0.1.3`.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 4 out of 4 changed files in this pull request and generated no comments.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/yaml/yaml_resolver.rb | Switches schema path defaulting to `Udb.default_schemas_path` and requires the new shared paths helper. |\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/version.rb | Version bump to 0.1.3. |\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/resolver.rb | Removes duplicated path helper methods and requires `paths.rb` instead. |\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/paths.rb | New shared implementation of repo vs installed-gem path defaults. |\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
